      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIGHT BOND (7) took the sit on the lead from a low draw but levelled up and led around the bend to score (22.89) at this track in a Maiden over 401m. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. AKII ALEJANDRO (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.17) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Shapes as one to consider. STAR PEDRO (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Hear No Grief (18.72) in a Grade 5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Can measure up. FROM THE ANGEL (3) is worth including.",
